The upstream snapshot is provenance, not a claim of runtime compatibility.
Adaptations target Isaac Sim 6.0.1: local installation and launch instructions
are replaced by Antioch's remote execution/startup model, project modules use
lazy simulator imports, and API corrections are checked against that runtime.
Domain examples and topic structure are retained. Project-specific incident
history and upstream agent-orchestration instructions are excluded. Each
reference links its original source; linked upstream scripts are not bundled.
